_⚠️ Potential issue_ | _🟠 Major_ | _⚡ Quick win_

**`returnToChatList` is too brittle with a fixed attempt cap.**

Line 236 limits recovery to 8 iterations (~1.6s total), which is frequently too short for slower CI/simulator navigation and causes flaky suite failures. Use a timeout-based loop instead of a hard attempt count.


<details>
<summary>💡 Suggested fix</summary>

```diff
-Future<void> returnToChatList(WidgetTester tester) async {
-  for (var attempt = 0; attempt < 8; attempt++) {
+Future<void> returnToChatList(
+  WidgetTester tester, {
+  Duration timeout = const Duration(seconds: 30),
+}) async {
+  final deadline = DateTime.now().add(timeout);
+  while (DateTime.now().isBefore(deadline)) {
     await tester.pump(const Duration(milliseconds: 200));
     if (find.byKey(const Key('chat_add_button')).evaluate().isNotEmpty) {
       return;
     }
@@
