_⚠️ Potential issue_ | _🟠 Major_ | _⚡ Quick win_

**Guard post-await state/ref access in async notice handlers.**

`analyticsNoticeLoading.value` (Line 314) and `ref.invalidate(...)` (Line 292) run after awaits without a mounted check. If the screen unmounts mid-flight, this can trigger disposed notifier/ref usage.



<details>
<summary>🔧 Suggested fix</summary>

